## Search and Filtering

The platform provides advanced filtering capabilities similar to leading marketplace applications.

Users can filter parking spaces using:

### Vehicle Filters

* Car
* Bike
* Electric Vehicle

### Security Filters

* CCTV
* Watchman
* Gated Access

### Infrastructure Filters

* Covered Parking
* Shed Coverage
* EV Charging
* Lighting

### Additional Filters

* Price Range
* Distance Radius
* Availability
* Ratings

Multiple filters can be combined simultaneously to provide accurate search results.

