## Architecture

The project follows a modular monorepo architecture designed for scalability and maintainability.

```text
Parkora/
├── client/      # React Frontend
├── server/      # Express Backend
├── shared/      # Shared Types, Constants and Validators
├── docker/      # Docker Configuration
└── prisma/      # Database Schema and Migrations
```

---

## Future Mobile Application Support

The platform is being developed using an API-first architecture.

After the web platform reaches production readiness, Parkora will be expanded into:

* Android Application
* iOS Application

Future mobile applications will reuse the existing backend APIs without requiring changes to core business logic.

